You splash around in the water for a while but seem  to have forgotten how to swim. Unfortunately, you drown.	你在水裡撲騰了一會兒，卻好像忘記了怎麼游泳。很不幸，你淹死了。
Where do you think it could be?	你覺得它會在哪裡呢？
KQ1	KQ1
You feel a stretching sensation... Oh, you're back to your original size.	你感覺到一陣伸展感……哦，你恢復原本的大小了。
You're too busy right now to rub the ring.	你現在正忙著別的事，沒空摩擦戒指。
There is no reason to do that now.	現在沒有理由這麼做。
As soon as you swallow the first bite, you have this strange shrinking feeling...  It's true!  You are now no bigger than a mouse!	你才吞下第一口，就感覺到一股奇怪的收縮感……真的沒錯！你現在變得比老鼠還小！
You need to be closer to the water if you want to swim.	你得靠近水邊一點，才能游泳。
VERSION 2.0F	VERSION 2.0F
The goat quickly eats the carrot and disappears.	山羊很快吃掉胡蘿蔔，接著就消失了。
Now is not a good time to try and eat the mushroom.	現在不是吃蘑菇的好時機。
You do not have a bowl.	你身上沒有碗。
It is not nice to tease the goat.	捉弄山羊可不太好。
You are not carrying it.	你身上沒有帶著它。
There is no reason to drop it.	沒有理由把它丟掉。
You need to be in water to swim.	你得先進到水裡才能游泳。
>	>
You do not have any stew.	你身上沒有燉肉。
The stew is chock full of vegetables and meat.	這碗燉肉裡滿滿都是蔬菜和肉。
You already have a full bowl of stew.	你已經有一碗裝滿的燉肉了。
The bowl fills with the delicious stew, but the woodcutters are unaware of it.	碗裡裝滿了美味的燉肉，但樵夫夫婦渾然不覺。
After uttering that strange word, the bowl starts quivering and immediately fills up with a delicious, hot stew.	你說出那個奇怪的字後，碗開始顫動，隨即裝滿了熱騰騰、美味的燉肉。
It is very inconsiderate to eat in front of these poor, starving people.  The pains of guilt set in on you.	在這些可憐挨餓的人面前吃東西，實在太不體貼了。一股愧疚感湧上心頭。
OK.	好的。
You're welcome!	不客氣！
There is no reason to throw the dagger.	沒有理由丟出短刀。
You don't want the dagger anymore.	你不再需要這把短刀了。
You hurl the dagger at the old goat... he tries to avoid the flying dagger, but your aim is true... as the dagger strikes, he slumps to the ground... dead.	你把短刀朝老山羊擲去……牠試圖閃避飛來的短刀，但你瞄得很準……短刀擊中的瞬間，牠癱倒在地……死了。
You don't have any way to kill the old goat.	你沒有辦法殺死這隻老山羊。
You've already killed the goat.	你已經殺死那隻山羊了。
The note reads, "Sometimes it is wise to think backwards."	紙條上寫著：「有時候，反過來想才是明智之舉。」
The word on the bottom of the bowl says "fill".	碗底寫著一個字：「裝滿」。
Even a small portion of the stew is very appetizing.	就算只有一小份燉肉，也令人食指大動。
You have already opened the pouch.	你已經打開過皮袋了。
You're going to be sorry!!  These were magic beans!	你會後悔的！！這些可是魔豆啊！
You slip the beautiful ring on one of your fingers.	你把這只美麗的戒指戴上手指。
I don't know why, but you drop the magic ring.	不知道為什麼，你把魔戒弄掉了。
When the ring disappears, you reappear!	戒指消失的瞬間，你重新現形了！
When you rub the magic ring, you mysteriously disappear, except for your footprints.	你摩擦魔戒的瞬間，神秘地消失了，只留下腳印。
You rub the magic ring but the goat seems to have a strange effect on it.	你摩擦魔戒，但山羊似乎對它產生了奇怪的影響。
With disappointment, you see that nothing happens.	你失望地發現，什麼事也沒發生。
The spell to make you invisible has expired and you are once again visible to dangerous creatures, but, the ring has now disappeared.	隱身魔法已經失效，你再次現形，可能被危險的生物看見；魔戒也已經消失無蹤。
You will have to find it before you can get it.	你得先找到它，才能拿到手。
You do not have it.	你身上沒有它。
_	_
You are not wearing the ring.	你並沒有戴著戒指。
There is no need to rub the ring as you are already invisible.	你已經是隱形狀態了，沒有必要再摩擦戒指。
