Misfortune strikes and you have fallen into the moat. Your struggles and cries have attracted hungry alligators.  They do not want to let you go.	厄運降臨，你掉進了護城河。你的掙扎和呼救聲引來了饑餓的鱷魚，牠們不打算放你走。
King Edward's banners are waving in the strong breeze.	愛德華國王的旗幟在強風中飄揚。
This is the castle of King Edward the Benevolent.	這裡是仁慈的愛德華國王的城堡。
It looks deep and dangerous.  You can see alligators  floating in the water.	這裡看起來又深又危險，你能看見鱷魚在水中漂浮。
The water in the moat is not conducive to swimming.	護城河裡的水不適合游泳。
They are absolutely gorgeous!	它們美極了！
It is a very small,  wooden barrel bridge.	這是一座非常小的木桶橋。
The alligators are swimming in the moat.	鱷魚正在護城河裡游動。
There are alligators in this water.  I don't think you want to try drinking it.	這片水裡有鱷魚，我想你應該不會想喝這裡的水。
There is water nearby.	附近有水。
King Edward does not allow anyone to take his flowers.	愛德華國王不准任何人摘他的花。
The moats slippery sides prevent you from getting out.	護城河濕滑的河岸讓你爬不出去。
You are standing outside a castle surrounded by an alligator filled moat.	你站在一座城堡外，城堡周圍環繞著滿是鱷魚的護城河。
High above the castle, the flags are waving in the wind.	城堡高處，旗幟正在風中飄揚。
You must enter the castle through the door, and the  door is closed.	你得從門進入城堡，但這扇門是關著的。
You never know what might be in there!	你永遠不知道裡面會有什麼！
It is a rather small, wooden bridge.	這是一座相當小的木橋。
These alligators have protected the castle from many a trespasser.	這些鱷魚已經擋下了不少入侵者，保護了這座城堡。
They pose as immovable guards for King Edward's castle, and have frightened off numerous intruders.	牠們就像愛德華國王城堡不動如山的守衛，已經嚇跑了無數入侵者。
These doors are strongly built to keep out unwanted visitors.	這扇門建得十分堅固，用來擋住不速之客。
You can't see them from here.	你在這裡看不到它們。
As you kneel by the edge of the moat and see just how filthy the water is, your thirst strangely leaves you.	你跪在護城河邊，看清這水有多骯髒後，奇怪地不渴了。
Although you notice the water is unclean, you fill the bucket.	雖然你注意到水並不乾淨，你還是把水桶裝滿了。
You are not close enough to any water.	你離任何水源都不夠近。
You have no container for water.	你沒有可以裝水的容器。
You have been to the castle once and you may not return until your quest is complete.	你已經去過一次城堡，在完成任務之前不能再回去。
You have been to the castle once since your quest and  are not allowed to return again.	自從展開任務後，你已經去過一次城堡，不准再回去了。
Since the goat is with you, permission to enter the  castle is denied.	由於山羊跟著你，你不准進入城堡。
The huge doors swing open slowly.	巨大的門緩緩敞開。
Your knock echos within the castle.  Unfortunately, no one answers.	你的敲門聲在城堡裡迴盪，可惜沒有人應門。
There are numerous white birch trees reaching to the sky.	許多白樺樹高聳入雲。
After moving that rock once, even thinking about it should make you tired.	你已經搬過那塊石頭一次了，光是想到要再搬就讓你累。
With a heave and a ho, you manage to move the rock... revealing a dark hole underneath it.	你使勁一推，總算把石頭搬開……底下露出一個黑漆漆的洞。
This moving rock rolls downhill and you, unfortunately,  are in the way.	這塊石頭滾下山坡，而你不巧擋在它的去路上。
It is a large rock with a hole next to it.	這是一塊大石頭，旁邊有個洞。
There is a rock in the distance.	遠處有一塊石頭。
You are too far from the hole to see in it.	你離那個洞太遠，看不清裡面。
You are in a forest clearing.  There is a large rock here.	你身處一片林間空地，這裡有一塊大石頭。
